{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["We do not know his era, nor can we say that he is the one mentioned in the book of Kings in the days of Ahab, for there it is written: \"and Obadiah feared YHWH,\" and if this were the prophet himself, how would Scripture call him one who fears HaShem and not call him a prophet, when prophecy is the more exalted rank?! And in my opinion: כי שמועה שמענו — this prophet and Jeremiah and Isaiah and Amos, who prophesied concerning Edom, therefore he said: שמענו." "<b>וציר</b> — as though a messenger is sent among the nations that joined together, and each said to the other: קומו."], :book :obadiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Obadiah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=18&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:20:28.759594538Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}